        HENCE FULFILLED
    OTHERWISE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed on these facts

-- src:1652 | 12. Any amendment to this Regulation pursuant to paragraph 10, or relevant delegated or implementing acts, which concerns sectoral Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I shall take into account the regulatory specificities of each sector, and the existing governance, conformity assessment and enforcement mechanisms and authorities established therein.
@ref Art 112(12) (src:1652)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the amendment, delegated act or implementing act concerns sectoral Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 112(12) the amendment or act must take into account the regulatory specificities of each sector` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 80 to 98 and 101 and 112 the group General applies` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Article 113 gives this provision its date of application; before that nothing is owed
    ELSE IF `the amendment, delegated act or implementing act concerns sectoral Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the duty is for acts "which concern sectoral Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I"; for another act it is silent (a scope limit with no "only": ruling (c) of 2026-11-05)

@ref Art 112(12)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the amendment, delegated act or implementing act concerns sectoral Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Art 112 party` `Art 112 act`
`Art 112(12) the duty to take into account the regulatory specificities of each sector` MEANS
    CONSIDER `Art 112(12) the amendment or act must take into account the regulatory specificities of each sector` `the date asked` `the amendment, delegated act or implementing act concerns sectoral Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN
        PARTY `Art 112 the Commission`
        MUST `Art 112(12) take into account the regulatory specificities of each sector and the existing governance, conformity assessment and enforcement mechanisms and authorities`
        HENCE FULFILLED
    OTHERWISE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed on these facts

§ `Article 112(13): the assessment of the enforcement by 2 August 2031`

-- src:1653 | 13. By 2 August 2031, the Commission shall carry out an assessment of the enforcement of this Regulation and shall report on it to the European Parliament, the Council and the European Economic and Social Committee, taking into account the first years of application of this Regulation. On the basis of the findings, that report shall, where appropriate, be accompanied by a proposal for amendment of this Regulation with regard to the structure of enforcement and the need for a Union agency to resolve any identified shortcomings.
@ref Art 112(13) (src:1653)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the day from which the time is counted` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Art 112 party` `Art 112 act`
`Art 112(13) the duty of the Commission to assess the enforcement of this Regulation and report` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 80 to 98 and 101 and 112 the group General applies` `the date asked`)
    THEN FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: Article 113 gives this provision its date of application
    ELSE PARTY `Art 112 the Commission`
         MUST `Art 112(13) carry out an assessment of the enforcement of this Regulation and report on it to the European Parliament, the Council and the European Economic and Social Committee`
         WITHIN (Day (Date 2 8 2031)) MINUS (Day `the day from which the time is counted`)
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST BREACH BY `Art 112 the Commission` BECAUSE "the Commission did not carry out the assessment of the enforcement of this Regulation and report on it by 2 August 2031"

@ref Art 112(13)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the findings are available` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is appropriate to accompany the report with a proposal for amendment of this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 112(13) the report must be accompanied by a proposal for amendment of this Regulation` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 80 to 98 and 101 and 112 the group General applies` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Article 113 gives this provision its date of application; before that nothing is owed
    ELSE IF NOT `the findings are available`
         THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "On the basis of the findings, that report shall, where appropriate, be accompanied by a proposal"
         ELSE IF `it is appropriate to accompany the report with a proposal for amendment of this Regulation`
              THEN JUST TRUE
              ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "that report shall, where appropriate, be accompanied by a proposal for amendment of this Regulation" (a "where appropriate" gate on a duty that is not met: fork F-112-3)
